    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002de', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000026', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002dd', N'incident', N'completed', N'completed', 100, N'[{"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "triage", "message": "Reading the incident and the application''s service catalogue"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "triage", "message": "Triage complete: priority P1, category security, 2 service(s) to examine"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "context", "message": "Context ready: 2 runbook match(es), 3 dependency link(s) in the neighbourhood"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "evidence", "message": "Querying telemetry for 2 service(s) over 90 minutes and a matching baseline"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "evidence", "message": "Collected 10 evidence items; 6 with a medium or high signal"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "hypotheses", "message": "Three analysts (application, dependencies, infrastructure) are forming hypotheses in parallel"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "synthesis", "message": "Comparing the three hypotheses and writing the root cause analysis"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "synthesis", "message": "Root cause analysis written; mapping the blast radius"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "synthesis", "message": "Blast radius mapped: 2 direct, 0 indirect"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "communications", "message": "Drafting English and Japanese updates"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "completed", "message": "Investigation complete"}]', '2026-11-07 04:29:00.000000', '2026-11-07 05:59:00.000000', '2026-11-07 02:59:00.000000', '2026-11-07 04:29:00.000000', N'{"suggested_priority": "P1", "priority_rationale": "Customer-facing impact on a Channel APIs for Digital (AU) journey with a recent onset; priority follows the reported impact and urgency.", "incident_category": "security", "candidate_service_names": ["channel-gateway-app"], "incident_summary": "Channel APIs for Digital (AU): all calls to the policy core system failing. Users and systems of Channel APIs for Digital (AU) are affected.", "key_symptoms": ["all calls to the policy core system failing"], "time_of_onset_hint": "Shortly before the incident was opened", "contains_instruction_like_text": false, "final_priority": "P1", "guardrail_priority": null, "mapped_servicenow_priority": "P2"}', N'A security certificate that Channel APIs for Digital (AU) uses to talk to the policy core system expired at midnight UTC, so most calls fail. A new certificate must be issued and loaded; service returns once it is in place.', N'Calls from Channel APIs for Digital (AU) to the policy core system fail with TLS errors, so channel API operations that need policy data are unavailable [E2].', N'The mutual-TLS client certificate used to call the policy core system expired at 00:00 UTC. The first failure appears at that moment and the error text states that the certificate has expired [E2]. No change was deployed, which fits a time-based cause.', N'Rotate the expired mutual-TLS client certificate and restart the dependent services so they load it.

1. Confirm the expiry date of the certificate presented to policy-core (read-only).

```
openssl s_client -connect policy-core.internal.example:443 -servername policy-core.internal.example </dev/null 2>/dev/null | openssl x509 -noout -enddate
```

2. Issue a replacement certificate and import it into Key Vault (vault and certificate names are not recorded in the knowledge base; confirm them with the platform team).
3. Restart the app service channel-gateway-app.

```
az webapp restart --name channel-gateway-app --resource-group RG_14470_AUCHAD_PRD01
```

4. Durable fix: add a certificate-expiry alert at 30, 14 and 7 days and automate rotation.

**Verify:** TLS handshake errors disappear from the logs. Channel API availability returns above 99 percent.

**Rollback:** No rollback is possible for an expired certificate; escalate to the certificate authority team if issuance is delayed.', N'["Which team owns renewal of this certificate?", "Are other certificates from the same issuance batch about to expire?"]', 0.88, N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002ec', N'{"nodes": [{"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000002f", "serviceName": "channel-gateway-app", "serviceType": "app_service", "criticalityTier": "tier_1", "impactLevel": "direct"}, {"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000002b", "serviceName": "chad-apim", "serviceType": "api_management", "criticalityTier": "tier_1", "impactLevel": "direct"}], "edges": [{"fromServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000002b", "toServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000002f", "kind": "calls"}], "impactedSlos": [{"sloId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000264", "sliId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000261", "applicationId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000026", "applicationName": "Channel APIs for Digital (AU)", "serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000002b", "serviceName": "chad-apim", "sliName": "chad-apim: Gateway availability", "sliKind": "availability", "isHeadline": true, "isApproximate": false, "targetPercentage": 99.5, "rollingWindowDays": 30, "compliancePercentage": 99.841, "errorBudgetRemainingPercentage": 68.2, "errorBudgetRemainingMinutes": 147.3, "errorBudgetTotalMinutes": 216.0, "burnRateOneHour": 0.77, "burnRateSixHours": 0.77, "status": "healthy", "sparkline": [99.928, 99.928, 99.922, 99.926, 99.921, 99.928, 99.923, 99.929, 99.923, 99.802, 98.855, 99.616, 99.615, 99.616, 99.614]}, {"sloId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000266", "sliId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000263", "applicationId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000026", "applicationName": "Channel APIs for Digital (AU)", "serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000002b", "serviceName": "chad-apim", "sliName": "chad-apim: Gateway latency", "sliKind": "latency", "isHeadline"