9.653, 99.306, 98.958, 99.306, 99.653, 98.958, 98.264, 98.958, 97.222]}], "stakeholders": [{"displayName": "Aiko AppAdmin", "role": "sre", "preferredLanguageCode": "ja"}], "narrativeMarkdown": "benefits-portal is the primary point of failure (benefits-portal).", "userImpactSummary": "Users of Employee Benefits Portal (SaaS) experience errors or delays in the affected journey."}', N'[{"referenceCode": "K1", "title": "Application topology", "sourceKind": "topology", "knowledgeDocumentId": null}]', N'correct', NULL, N'keigan.admin@keigan.local', NULL, 8214, 2355, N'["offline-factory"]', N'system:seed', '2026-11-11 06:26:00.000000', '2026-11-11 06:29:00.000000', '2026-11-11 06:26:00.000000', '2026-11-20 12:00:00.000000', N'system:seed', NULL),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000318', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000317', N'incident', N'completed', N'completed', 100, N'[{"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "triage", "message": "Reading the incident and the application''s service catalogue"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "triage", "message": "Triage complete: priority P2, category dependency, 6 service(s) to examine"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "context", "message": "Context ready: 3 runbook match(es), 6 dependency link(s) in the neighbourhood"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "evidence", "message": "Querying telemetry for 6 service(s) over 107 minutes and a matching baseline"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "evidence", "message": "Collected 27 evidence items; 10 with a medium or high signal"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "hypotheses", "message": "Three analysts (application, dependencies, infrastructure) are forming hypotheses in parallel"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "synthesis", "message": "Comparing the three hypotheses and writing the root cause analysis"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "synthesis", "message": "Root cause analysis written; mapping the blast radius"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "synthesis", "message": "Blast radius mapped: 4 direct, 2 indirect"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "communications", "message": "Drafting English and Japanese updates"}, {"at": "2026-11-20T12:00:00+00:00", "stage": "completed", "message": "Investigation complete"}]', '2026-11-14 02:22:00.000000', '2026-11-14 04:09:00.000000', '2026-11-14 00:35:00.000000', '2026-11-14 02:22:00.000000', N'{"suggested_priority": "P2", "priority_rationale": "Customer-facing impact on a Claims Processing (JP) journey with a recent onset; priority follows the reported impact and urgency.", "incident_category": "dependency", "candidate_service_names": ["claims-api", "claims-sql"], "incident_summary": "Claims Processing (JP): claim submissions failing with timeouts. Users and systems of Claims Processing (JP) are affected.", "key_symptoms": ["claim submissions failing with timeouts"], "time_of_onset_hint": "Shortly before the incident was opened", "contains_instruction_like_text": true, "final_priority": "P2", "guardrail_priority": null, "mapped_servicenow_priority": "P2"}', N'Claim submissions in Claims Processing (JP) are failing because a recent configuration change overloaded the claims database connections. Customers see long waits and errors when submitting claims. The change can be reverted and the service restarted; recovery is expected within minutes of doing so.', N'Claim submissions on Claims Processing (JP) began failing with timeouts. Error patterns on claims-api that did not exist before the incident ([E2]) show requests waiting for a database connection until they time out, and claims-sql was running at its session limit [E1].', N'A configuration change raised batch import parallelism from 4 to 16 [E9]. Each import thread holds a database connection, so the connection pool of claims-api was exhausted and normal requests queued behind the imports [E2]. claims-sql reached its session limit as a result [E1]. Timing of the change, the first errors and the session growth line up within minutes.', N'Restore the previous batch import concurrency, restart the service to release saturated connections, then cap parallelism below the pool size.

1. Restore BATCH_IMPORT_PARALLELISM=4 on claims-api.

```
kubectl set env deployment/claims-api BATCH_IMPORT_PARALLELISM=4 -n claims
```

2. Restart claims-api so new pods pick up the corrected configuration.

```
kubectl rollout restart deployment/claims-api -n claims
```

3. Confirm SQL sessions are falling back below 60 percent.

```
az monitor metrics list --resource /subscriptions/8d1c3f2a-4b6e-4c1d-9a7f-21530c1a0001/resourceGroups/RG_21530_CLMJP_PRD01/providers/Microsoft.Sql/servers/databases/claims-sql --metric sessions_percent --interval PT5M --aggregation Maximum
```

4. Durable fix: size the connection pool for peak parallelism and reject configuration where parallelism exceeds the pool.

**Verify:** Failed requests on POST /api/claims return to baseline within 10 minutes. SQL sessions stay below 60 percent for 30 minutes.

**Rollback:** If errors persist, scale the service back to its previous replica count and reopen the investigation.', N'["Was the change to BATCH_IMPORT_PARALLELISM approved and tested against the SQL session limit?", "Are other services sharing the same database session limit?"]', 0.86, N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000339', N'{"nodes": [{"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006", "serviceName": "claims-api", "serviceType": "aks", "criticalityTier": "tier_1", "impactLevel": "direct"}, {"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015", "serviceName": "claims-sql", "serviceType": "sql_database", "criticalityTier": "tier_1", "impactLevel": "direct"}, {"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005", "serviceName": "claims-apim", "serviceType": "api_management", "criticalityTier": "tier_1", "impactLevel": "direct"}, {"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c", "serviceName": "claims-intake-func", "serviceType": "function_app", "criticalityTier": "tier_2", "impactLevel": "direct"}, {"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000f", "serviceName": "claims-workflow", "serviceType": "logic_app", "criticalityTier": "tier_2", "impactLevel": "indirect"}, {"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012", "serviceName": "claims-nightly-etl", "serviceType": "data_factory", "criticalityTier": "tier_3", "impactLevel": "indirect"}, {"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009", "serviceName": "claims-document-renderer", "serviceType": "aks", "criticalityTier": "tier_2", "impactLevel": "investigated"}], "edges": [{"fromServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005", "toServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006", "kind": "calls"}, {"fromServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006", "toServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015", "kind": "writes_to"}, {"fromServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006", "toServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009", "kind": "calls"}, {"fromServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8