te_service_names": ["premium-billing-batch"], "incident_summary": "Policy Administration Mainframe (US): nightly premium billing batch did not complete. Users and systems of Policy Administration Mainframe (US) are affected.", "key_symptoms": ["nightly premium billing batch did not complete"], "time_of_onset_hint": "Shortly before the incident was opened", "contains_instruction_like_text": false, "final_priority": "P2", "guardrail_priority": null, "mapped_servicenow_priority": "P2"}', N'The nightly premium billing run in Policy Administration Mainframe (US) stopped part-way because one input record is malformed. Statements for the billing cycle are delayed until the record is corrected and the job is restarted from the failed step.', N'The nightly premium billing batch for Policy Administration Mainframe (US) did not complete: job PBIL0400 abended in step STEP030 [E1], so downstream statements were not produced.', N'PBIL0400 abended with S0C7, a data exception, in program PBILCALC [E1]. This happens when the program does arithmetic on a field that is not valid packed decimal, most likely a malformed premium amount in the input data set.', N'Correct or skip the malformed input record, then restart the job from the failed step as the runbook describes.

1. Identify the malformed packed-decimal premium amount in PBIL.INPUT.D1119 from the dump of step STEP030.
2. Correct or remove the record in a copy of the input data set (data change, requires batch operations approval).
3. Restart PBIL0400 from STEP030.

```
//PBIL0400 JOB (ACCT),''PREMIUM BILLING'',RESTART=STEP030
```

4. Check that downstream statement generation starts and completes.

**Verify:** PBIL0400 ends with condition code 0000. Downstream statements are produced for the billing cycle.

**Rollback:** Keep the original input data set untouched so the run can be repeated.', N'["Which upstream extract produced the malformed premium amount?", "Is it safe to skip the record or must it be corrected first?"]', 0.85, N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000003a6', N'{"nodes": [{"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005c", "serviceName": "premium-billing-batch", "serviceType": "batch_job_stream", "criticalityTier": "tier_1", "impactLevel": "direct"}, {"serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005b", "serviceName": "cics-policy-online", "serviceType": "mainframe_subsystem", "criticalityTier": "tier_1", "impactLevel": "investigated"}], "edges": [{"fromServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005c", "toServiceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005b", "kind": "reads_from"}], "impactedSlos": [{"sloId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002a5", "sliId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002a2", "applicationId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000058", "applicationName": "Policy Administration Mainframe (US)", "serviceId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000005c", "serviceName": "premium-billing-batch", "sliName": "premium-billing-batch: Batch job success", "sliKind": "run_success", "isHeadline": false, "isApproximate": false, "targetPercentage": 99.5, "rollingWindowDays": 30, "compliancePercentage": 99.757, "errorBudgetRemainingPercentage": 51.4, "errorBudgetRemainingMinutes": 111.0, "errorBudgetTotalMinutes": 216.0, "burnRateOneHour": 0.0, "burnRateSixHours": 0.0, "status": "healthy", "sparkline": [100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 99.653, 100.0, 99.653, 93.75, 100.0, 100.0]}], "stakeholders": [{"displayName": "Kai Admin", "role": "sre", "preferredLanguageCode": "en"}], "narrativeMarkdown": "premium-billing-batch is the primary point of failure (premium-billing-batch).", "userImpactSummary": "Users of Policy Administration Mainframe (US) experience errors or delays in the affected journey."}', N'[{"referenceCode": "K1", "title":