INSERT INTO #demo_rows ([communication_id], [incident_id], [investigation_id], [communication_type], [audience_type], [language_code], [subject_line], [body_markdown], [communication_status], [approved_by_user_principal_name], [approved_at], [sent_at], [created_at], [updated_at], [created_by_user_principal_name], [updated_by_user_principal_name]) VALUES
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002ce', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002ae', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002af', N'initial_update', N'stakeholders', N'en', N'[P2] Claims Processing (JP): Initial update', N'We are aware of an issue affecting Claims Processing (JP) (claims-document-renderer, claims-apim). Parts of Claims Processing (JP) intermittently fail because a service keeps running out of memory and restarting. Users see occasional errors when documents are rendered. A temporary memory increase and restart stabilise it; the underlying memory leak needs a code fix.

- **Status:** investigating
- **Next update:** the time of the next update will be confirmed', N'sent', N'keigan.admin@keigan.local', '2026-11-03 04:39:00.000000', '2026-11-03 04:40:00.000000', '2026-11-03 04:38:00.000000', '2026-11-20 12:00:00.000000', N'system:keigan', NULL),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002cf', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002ae', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002af', N'initial_update', N'stakeholders', N'ja', N'【P2】Claims Processing (JP): 初報', N'関係者各位

Claims Processing (JP)で障害を確認しています。影響を受けているサービス: claims-document-renderer, claims-apim。

- 影響: ゲートウェイで断続的に502エラーが発生しています。
- 現状: 調査中。暫定の原因分析では、ドキュメントレンダラーのコンテナがメモリ上限（1GiB）に達してOOMKilledとなり、再起動を繰り返していることが原因と見ています。（確度 約82%）
- 次回報告: 時刻は改めてお知らせします

詳細が分かり次第、改めてご連絡します。', N'sent', N'keigan.admin@keigan.local', '2026-11-03 04:39:00.000000', '2026-11-03 04:40:00.000000', '2026-11-03 04:38:00.000000', '2026-11-20 12:00:00.000000', N'system:keigan', NULL),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002d0', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002ae', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002af', N'executive_summary', N'executives', N'en', N'[P2] Claims Processing (JP): Executive summary', N'Parts of Claims Processing (JP) intermittently fail because a service keeps running out of memory and restarting. Users see occasional errors when documents are rendered. A temporary memory increase and restart stabilise it; the underlying memory leak needs a code fix.

- **Status:** recovery in progress
- **Next update:** the time of the next update will be confirmed', N'sent', N'keigan.admin@keigan.local', '2026-11-03 04:39:00.000000', '2026-11-03 04:40:00.000000', '2026-11-03 04:38:00.000000', '2026-11-20 12:00:00.000000', N'system:keigan', NULL),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002d1', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002ae', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002af', N'executive_summary', N'executives', N'ja', N'【P2】Claims Processing (JP): 経営層向けサマリー', N'Claims Processing (JP)で障害が発生しています。

- 影響: ゲートウェイで断続的に502エラーが発生しています。
- 想定される原因: ドキュメントレンダラーのコンテナがメモリ上限（1GiB）に達してOOMKilledとなり、再起動を繰り返していることが原因と見ています。
- 対応状況: 復旧作業を進めています。
- 次回報告: 時刻は改めてお知らせします', N'sent', N'keigan.admin@keigan.local', '2026-11-03 04:39:00.000000', '2026-11-03 04:40:00.000000', '2026-11-03 04:38:00.000000', '2026-11-20 12:00:00.000000', N'system:keigan', NULL),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002d2', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002ae', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000002af', N'preliminary_report', N'stakeholders', N'en', N'[P2] Claims Processing (JP): Preliminary report', N'**Impact:** claims-document-renderer, claims-apim are affected.

**Likely cause (confidence 82%):** Containers of claims-document-renderer reach their 1 GiB memory limit and are killed by the kernel [E4]. Memory grows by roughly 300 MB per hour, which indicates a leak in the document renderer rather than a one-off spike. While pods restart the gateway has no healthy backend and returns 502.

**Mitigation:** see the proposed fix in the investigation.

